{"2390130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Design and Conjure", "steam_appid": 2390130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing the Witch Academy, Dalia comes home to find her town fading under mysterious corruption. Magical creatures are distressed and the village has fallen into disarray. Use cleaning and decorating to mend its scars, reconnect with magical beings, and restore its lost warmth and balance at a calm, soothing pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/b2c4fb51e6d181d45a452f6655240e45.poster.avif?t=1785396653\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/b2c4fb51e6d181d45a452f6655240e45.webm?t=1785396653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/b2c4fb51e6d181d45a452f6655240e45.mp4?t=1785396653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/d588e16e600e00137a565b49159b7b1f.avif?t=1785396653\" width=780 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your ideal space across 7 unique levels and 12 magical areas, from cozy bedrooms to enchanted forest groves, each with its own style and layout. Choose from over 1,000 decorations and 30+ room layouts, customize colors, sizes and weather with nature magic, and even copy your favorite pieces. Every detail, from small trinkets to full-room design, is fully under your control.🪄</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/a34b4bed7240ed0737244f3d2a10c70a.poster.avif?t=1785396653\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/a34b4bed7240ed0737244f3d2a10c70a.webm?t=1785396653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/a34b4bed7240ed0737244f3d2a10c70a.mp4?t=1785396653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/447748f526b10e76c03eef5698ae40e0.avif?t=1785396653\" width=780 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll meet 6 distinct witches and wizards, and 5 adorable magical creatures around town. Chat with them, listen to their stories, and soothe the restless creatures with gentle care. Build warm magical bonds and uncover the hidden secrets of the town as you spend time together.🐿️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/2e6022ab05e202b86f724a15eac0ff71.poster.avif?t=1785396653\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/2e6022ab05e202b86f724a15eac0ff71.webm?t=1785396653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/2e6022ab05e202b86f724a15eac0ff71.mp4?t=1785396653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/7ccd0fd80f4e2d256d1a2c340a302827.avif?t=1785396653\" width=780 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level holds a variety of fun quests, from basic cleaning, organizing and unpacking to light puzzle-based object placement. Every completed quest brings visible change to the town. Solve them at your own pace, watch the town bloom again on the map, and enjoy a satisfying sense of accomplishment.🤍</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/adbecedccd3b5acd117b43f376cc8bee.poster.avif?t=1785396653\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/adbecedccd3b5acd117b43f376cc8bee.webm?t=1785396653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/adbecedccd3b5acd117b43f376cc8bee.mp4?t=1785396653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/640f390966e8db07c61e45fd6c231eb4.avif?t=1785396653\" width=780 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new music tracks around the town and immerse yourself in an original lo-fi soundtrack with soft sound effects that accompany your every move: birds chirping, rain, thunder and more sound effects that blend in to create a rich, cozy atmosphere throughout the magical world.🍵</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/871e3056a39d529545974a78538e1c88.poster.avif?t=1785396653\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/871e3056a39d529545974a78538e1c88.webm?t=1785396653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/871e3056a39d529545974a78538e1c88.mp4?t=1785396653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/52de027d8b477a0af5ada23d6e3bbe0c.avif?t=1785396653\" width=780 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Immersive Story: Uncover the town’s past as you explore 7 unique levels and decorate 12 distinctive rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Abundant Content: Over 1,000 decorations, 30+ room layouts, plus customizable weather and backgrounds. Every room can be styled uniquely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Creative Mode: Freely design and build in a dedicated creative mode, with no quests or pressure to craft your perfect cottage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 Light Puzzle Gameplay: Fun quests solvable in multiple ways, so you can earn a fulfilling sense of achievement with easy, relaxed gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧸 Warm Encounters: Meet distinct magical companions, comfort and heal adorable magical creatures, and forge heartfelt bonds throughout the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧿 Meditative Gameplay: No timers, no pressure! Just sit back, relax, and savor the joy of tidying and creating.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing the Witch Academy, Dalia comes home to find her town fading under mysterious corruption. Magical creatures are distressed and the village has fallen into disarray. Use cleaning and decorating to mend its scars, reconnect with magical beings, and restore its lost warmth and balance at a calm, soothing pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"h