ls and decorate 12 distinctive rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Abundant Content: Over 1,000 decorations, 30+ room layouts, plus customizable weather and backgrounds. Every room can be styled uniquely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Creative Mode: Freely design and build in a dedicated creative mode, with no quests or pressure to craft your perfect cottage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 Light Puzzle Gameplay: Fun quests solvable in multiple ways, so you can earn a fulfilling sense of achievement with easy, relaxed gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧸 Warm Encounters: Meet distinct magical companions, comfort and heal adorable magical creatures, and forge heartfelt bonds throughout the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧿 Meditative Gameplay: No timers, no pressure! Just sit back, relax, and savor the joy of tidying and creating.</p>", "short_description": "Join Dalia, the Nature Witch, on a heartwarming journey to restore her hometown. Tidy spaces, design magical rooms, solve gentle puzzles, and soothe magical creatures affected by mysterious corruption bringing warmth and peace back to the town. 🌸", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, German, French, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/f107d5897a0cd803f3059de0e51220a49b4b58bc/header.jpg?t=1785396653", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/ef0e3868212fcc9ad7c1eab485f3f5109c69260b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785396653", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/ef0e3868212fcc9ad7c1eab485f3f5109c69260b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785396653", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.5 GHz<br></li>